<div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">殷&nbsp; &nbsp; 雷<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_30.html\" target=\"_blank\">落雪</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">1</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳煒翰<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_66.html\" target=\"_blank\">新希望</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">2<br /><br /></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">黃子佳<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/e_78.html\" target=\"_blank\">黃昏ê平洋</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">3<br /><br /></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">江&nbsp; &nbsp; 遲<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_25.html\" target=\"_blank\">譜寫</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>4</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">劉阿昌<br /><i><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/mi-so-mi-la.html\" target=\"_blank\">Mi so Mi La</a></i></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">5</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">李月滿<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_3.html\" target=\"_blank\">雨</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">7</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">丁&nbsp; &nbsp; 津<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_96.html\" target=\"_blank\">捲螺仔</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">11</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿瑞--ā話仙</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">藍春瑞<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/tng.html\" target=\"_blank\">Tńg去看老爸</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>6</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台語sa攏有講座</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">主講／阿　達</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">記錄／吳宛霖<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_27.html\" target=\"_blank\">《予你的歌》專輯創作分享</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>8</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">轉型正義kap不當黨產台語講座</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">主講／莊佳穎</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">記錄／張翠硯<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/e-ehamtng.html\" target=\"_blank\">唱家己ê歌</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/e-ehamtng.html\" target=\"_blank\">——我ê認同hām語言tńg大人之路</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">10</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台灣人寫真</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">蔡月賓<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/ah.html\" target=\"_blank\">二舅離家出走--ah</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>12</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">媜&nbsp; &nbsp; 嫚<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_29.html\" target=\"_blank\">媽媽經</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>15</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">侯淑雅<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2023/12/blog-post_29.html\" target=\"_blank\">叫我滿足</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>17</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">劉子嫣<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/e_29.html\" target=\"_blank\">牆仔邊ê鹽桑仔</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>44</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lán來講看māi</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Li̍k-khá<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/kape-e.html\" target=\"_blank\">Kap囡仔講台語是一个溫柔ê選擇</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/kape-e.html\" target=\"_blank\">——參加台語路分享會ê心得</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">20</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tiuⁿ Bín-hâm<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/ko-peh-oe-ji-jin-bat-se-kai.html\" target=\"_blank\">Kō͘ Pe̍h-ōe-jī Jīn-bat Sè-kài</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/ko-peh-oe-ji-jin-bat-se-kai.html\" target=\"_blank\">Kō͘白話字認bat世界</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">45</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">讀冊開講</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">紀品志<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/ineetann-beh-aheetsittaue-khang.html\" target=\"_blank\">老母ê話，老母ê故事</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>23</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">寶島好食mi̍h</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">水&nbsp; &nbsp; 晶<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_5.html\" target=\"_blank\">煮食</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>30</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">游玉雯<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/e_20.html\" target=\"_blank\">阿媽ê水跤仔</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>32</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">張寶明<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/e_67.html\" target=\"_blank\">烏魚哪ē炒米粉</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">34</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳姿吟<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/timtui.html\" target=\"_blank\">冬節tīm補——tùi急燒仔講起</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>36</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Sann-kap讀小說</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">李淑貞<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t\n</span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/tibehe_29.html\" target=\"_blank\">行！Tī日頭beh落山ê時（四）</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>38</span></div><h3><s